<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-RESULTS IN THE SPANISH CUP, FOURTH ROUND.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS IN THE SPANISH CUP, FOURTH ROUND.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the Spanish Cup fourth round, second leg matches played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>    Real Betis	3   Tenerife	    0</p>
<p>(Betis won 5-0 on aggregate)</p>
<p>    Valencia	  0   Las Palmas (II)   2 aet</p>
<p>(2-2 on aggregate, Las Palmas won 5-3 on penalties)</p>
<p>    Celta Vigo	0   Lleida (II)	 0</p>
<p>(1-1 on aggregate, Celta won on away goals)</p>
<p>    Athletic Bilbao 1   Racing Santander  1</p>
<p>(Racing won 2-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p>    Espanyol	  0  Deportivo Coruna   0</p>
<p>(2-2 on aggregate, Espanyol won on away goals)</p>
<p>Played on Tuesday:</p>
<p>    Compostela	2   Atletico Madrid   3</p>
<p>(Atletico won 5-2 on aggregate)</p>
<p>Playing Thursday:</p>
<p>Real Madrid v Barcelona (2-3)</p>
<p>Extremadura v Rayo Vallecano (2-2)</p>
</text>
